Step 1F — Validate the AI response

This is where we stop trusting Gemini blindly.

Your backend should do:

Gemini
   ↓
Response
   ↓
Is it valid?
   │
   ├── YES → React
   │
   └── NO → Retry / fallback

For example:

if (
  !response.projectOverview ||
  !response.phases ||
  !Array.isArray(response.phases)
) {
   // invalid AI response
}

Later we'll make this much cleaner with a schema validator.

